seindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/71465542597_11_09_21.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/65731542597_23_12_20.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/5425970319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2018/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2018.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2017/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2017.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2016/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2016.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2015/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2015.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2014/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2014.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2011","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2011/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2011.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"MSTC reported its highest revenue from operations in four years at INR359.33 crores for FY26, driven by e-commerce activities including coal and mineral block auctions. The company is exiting its marketing and trading business to focus on becoming an e-commerce entity, with new digital platforms for EPR certificate trading and B2B travel services in final stages. Management aims for double-digit growth in its core e-commerce business and is monitoring potential impacts from emerging coal exchange developments. The company also highlighted a reduction in losses from its joint venture, MMRPL, and a strategic partnership with SBI CAPS for advisory services.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company aims to achieve double-digit growth in its core e-commerce business.","quote":"It would not be fair to put a number to it, but the attempt shall be to maintain a double-digit growth if possible.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects the EPR trading platform to contribute significantly to revenue.","quote":"But as I said, we are very positive about the fact that it should contribute significantly to our revenue, maybe to start with in the year itself as we go ahead.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company is in the final stages of launching an EPR trading platform and a B2B travel portal.","quote":"The two major such platforms that we are working on, the EPR, that is ETP, which we have already developed, and the next part of our digital project pipeline is a travel portal which is also in the final developmental stages and which we expect to launch shortly.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"EBITDA margin was maintained year-on-year despite competitive pressures.","quote":"With respect to the financials, we have been able to maintain EBITDA percentage at a similar level year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company successfully secured an order for coal linkage auctions from Coal India Limited.","quote":"And recently we have got an order through competitive bidding for coal linkage auction for Coal India Limited, through open tender.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company is exiting its marketing and trading business to focus on e-commerce.","quote":"So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management is monitoring the potential impact of a new coal exchange on its auction revenues.","quote":"So this is something at the very, very initial stages and we shall be watching these developments closely to see how they impact our revenue stream going on.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company will exit the marketing and trading business by the first quarter of FY27.","quote":"So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company expects to launch its B2B travel portal shortly.","quote":"This portal is also in its final stages of testing, and we expect to operationalize it shortly in the B2B space to begin with, and then extend segmental reach as we gain traction.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":1,"kinds":["concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":9,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":0,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped. Skipped \u2014 concall_transcript: GeminiBusy: all Gemini models busy or out of free-tier quota right now \u2014 wait ~1 min and retry, or switch provid; concall_ppt: GeminiBusy: all Gemini models busy or out of free-tier quota right now \u2014 wait ~1 min and retry, or switch provid"}}